{%- comment -%}
  Screen: subscription details.

  Only the two Phoenix-supported schedule changes are offered. Cadence,
  products, quantities, address and payment are read-only, because Phoenix
  documents no mutation for them in the portal's scope.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="spp__screen" data-spp-screen="subscription" hidden aria-labelledby="spp-sub-h">
  <button type="button" class="spp__back" data-spp-go="dashboard">
    {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'chevron-left' %}Overview
  </button>

  <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px;">
    <h1 class="spp__h1" id="spp-sub-h" style="margin:0;">Daily routine subscription</h1>
    <span class="spp__badge spp__badge--plain" data-spp-field="subscription.statusLabel" data-spp-status-badge>Active</span>
  </div>
  {%- comment -%}
    The subscription is described by when it started and how much has arrived,
    which is what a customer recognises. The Phoenix id said nothing they
    could use and belonged to a system they never see.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <p class="spp__lede" style="font-size:14.5px;color:var(--spp-muted);">
    Started <span data-spp-field="subscription.startedLong">12 March 2025</span> ·
    <span data-spp-field="subscription.deliveriesSoFar">9</span> deliveries so far
  </p>

  <div class="spp__split">
    <div class="spp__split-main">

      {%- comment -%} Cadence + price breakdown — all read-only {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="spp__card">
        <div style="padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(13,35,64,.08);">
          <div class="spp__eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:7px;">Cadence</div>
          <div style="font:600 16px/1.3 var(--spp-font);color:var(--spp-ink);">
            Every <span data-spp-field="subscription.intervalDays">60</span> days ·
            next <span data-spp-field="subscription.nextOrderShort">Sep 8</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="spp__lines">
          <div data-spp-list="lineSummary">
            <template data-spp-tpl="lineSummary">
              <div class="spp__line" style="margin-bottom:12px;">
                <span><span data-spp-field="title">FreshWipes jar</span> × <span data-spp-field="quantity">2</span></span>
                <b data-spp-field="linePrice">$49.80</b>
              </div>
            </template>
          </div>
          <div class="spp__line">
            <span>Subscriber discount (<span data-spp-field="subscription.discountPercent">10</span>%)</span>
            <b>−<span data-spp-field="pricing.discount">$6.97</span></b>
          </div>
          <div class="spp__line"><span>Shipping</span><b>Free</b></div>
          <hr class="spp__hr">
          <div class="spp__line spp__line--total"><span>Per delivery</span><b data-spp-field="pricing.total">$62.73</b></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} The two supported schedule changes {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="spp__card spp__card--rows">
        <button type="button" class="spp__row" data-spp-sheet="skip">
          <span class="spp__row-label">Skip next delivery
            <span class="spp__row-hint">Move <span data-spp-field="subscription.nextOrderShort">Sep 8</span> on by <span data-spp-field="subscription.intervalDays">60</span> days</span>
          </span>
          {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'chevron-right' %}
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="spp__row" data-spp-sheet="delay">
          <span class="spp__row-label">Delay or reschedule
            <span class="spp__row-hint">7, 15 or 30 days later</span>
          </span>
          {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'chevron-right' %}
        </button>
      </div>

      <p class="spp__note">
        Need to change products, quantities, delivery address or your card?
        <a href="#" data-spp-go="account">Message support</a> and we&rsquo;ll take care of it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="spp__split-side">
      <div class="spp__card spp__card--soft">
        <h2 class="spp__h2" style="font-size:16px;">Delivering to</h2>
        <p style="margin:0;font:500 14.5px/1.55 var(--spp-font);color:var(--spp-body);" data-spp-field-html="subscription.addressLines">
          Margaret Ellis<br>214 Wren Street, Apt 3B<br>Portland, OR 97209<br>United States
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="spp__card spp__card--soft">
        <h2 class="spp__h2" style="font-size:16px;">Payment</h2>
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;">
          <span style="width:44px;height:30px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--spp-ink);color:#fff;font:700 10px/30px var(--spp-font);text-align:center;display:block;" data-spp-field="subscription.paymentBrand">VISA</span>
          <span style="font:500 14.5px/1.3 var(--spp-font);color:var(--spp-body);">
            ···· <span data-spp-field="subscription.paymentLast4">4242</span> ·
            expires <span data-spp-field="subscription.paymentExpiry">04/28</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="spp__note" style="margin-top:12px;">Shown for reference only. This portal never displays or collects full card details.</p>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%}
        Enters the journey at Benefits, its first step. It used to jump
        straight to the reason list, which skipped the one screen that exists
        to give the customer a reason to stay.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--quiet" data-spp-go="cancel-benefits">Cancel subscription</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
